# Documents not migrated to the new documentation standard yet (issue #1257).
#
# A path listed here is not linted by scripts/wiki:lint and is not published to the GitHub Wiki.
# Patterns are relative to docs/ (fnmatch: `*` also matches `/`). Delete a line when its category has been migrated;
# the file is gone when the migration is complete.
archives/*
decisions/*
experiments/*
incidents/*
migrations/*
network/*
procedures/README.md
procedures/infrastructure/*
procedures/omni/*
procedures/security/*
reports/*
RENOVATE.md
